    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An exciting new development is coming soon to Holly Hill, Delgany by Lowick Homes!\r\nHooke & MacDonald are delighted to present the new stylish 2 , 3 and 4 bedroom homes.\r\n\r\nDiscover Holly Hill, a beautiful new development just a stroll from Delgany village, offering a vibrant lifestyle surrounded by scenic trails, parks, and the nearby coastline for walking, cycling, and water sports. Enjoy convenient access to Greystones' amenities, including sports clubs, markets, and children's play areas.\r\n\r\nExceptional Connectivity\r\n\r\nCommuters benefit from quick access to the DART in Greystones, several Dublin Bus routes, and the nearby N11 and M50 for travel to Dublin and beyond.\r\n\r\nLifestyle & Experience\r\n\r\nHolly Hill is more than a home; it's a lifestyle. Residents enjoy the serene surroundings of the Wicklow Mountains, coastal walks, and attractions like Powerscourt Estate. Local cafes and dining spots, such as The Horse and Hound and Firehouse Bakery, offer warm atmospheres and quality fare. For families, top-rated schools and childcare facilities are nearby, creating a nurturing environment for children.\r\n\r\nPlease register your interest on www.hollyhilldelgany.ie"
      },
